KR2026	Ch 3	AFP-C	{226}	AFP-C: to ships comply with the related requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 of the Guidance. (Cargo space) AFP-C(1): to container ships where cargo space in accordance with the requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 405. 2 of the Guidance. AFP-C(2): to container ships where cargo space in accordance with the requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 405. 3 of the Guidance. AFP-C(3): to container ships where cargo space in accordance with the requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 405. 4 of the Guidance. AFP-C(FSC): to container ships where cargo space in accordance with the requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 405. 5 of the Guidance. (Flooding System for Container) AFP-C(FSC-Structure): to container ships where cargo space in accordance with the requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec 4, 405. 5 of the Guidance. * Example of the notation when two or more symbol to be indicated at the same time : AFP-C(1, FSC) AFP-C(EV): to PCC notation assigned pure car carriers or pure car/truck carriers where cargo space in accordance with the requirements specified in Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 of the Guidance. (Electric Vehicles) * In assignment of the AFP-C(EV), for ships that partially satisfy the requirements of Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 of the Guidance, the characters corresponding to the satisfied items may be assigned in the bracket one or a combination of them in addition to AFP-C(EV). The characters corresponding to the items are as follows: FD : Combined type smoke and heat detectors, fire alarms in accordance with Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 (1) (A) of the Guidance. FC : Cameras (CCTV) in accordance with Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 (1) (B) of the Guidance. FI : AI based cameras (AI CCTV) in accordance with Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 (1) (C) of the Guidance. FT : Portable thermal imaging cameras in accordance with Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 (1) (D) of the Guidance. FE : Fixed fire extinguishing arrangement in accordance with Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 (2) of the Guidance. FA : Fire fighting equipment in accordance with Pt 8, Annex 8-9, Sec.4 402. 3 (3) (A) and (B) of the Guidance. * Example of the notation assignment for partially satisfied vessels : AFP-C(EV)(FD, FC)
